data: {"id": "552d94be93d04f6f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1029", "run_id": "552d94be93d04f6f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（支持/反驳/缺口）\n\n### 支持“CrashLoopBackOffRuntime”的事实\n- **Pod 当前状态**：`phase=Running`，但容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting`，`Reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready=False`；已重启 **12 次**（Prometheus `restarts_total=12`，describe 一致）。\n- **Last State 终止细节**：`Exit Code=127`，`Reason=Error`（describe 与 Pod YAML 一致；Prometheus `last_terminated_reason=Error` 值 1）。\n- **崩溃前日志**：`kubectl logs --previous` 与 ES 日志（6 条）均一致返回：`sh: exec: line 0: /opt/app/unavailable-command: not found`。\n- **Spec 配置**：`command: [\"sh\", \"-c\", \"exec /opt/app/", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789134068366, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

